## Dashboard overview (`OverviewPanel.tsx`)

### Deep links
`OverviewColumn` accepts `href?: string` on both the column title and individual `rows`:

```tsx
type OverviewRow = {
  label: string; value: string | number
  tone?: 'success' | 'danger' | 'neutral'
  href?: string   // wraps value in <RouterLink>
}
```

Column title with `href` wraps in `<RouterLink>` with `_hover={{ opacity: 0.8 }}`.
Row value with `href` wraps in `<RouterLink>` with `_hover={{ color: 'var(--app-accent)' }}`.

### Agent metrics wired to gateway
`failedRunCount` prop → sourced from `gatewaySummary?.recent_failed_runs` in `DashboardPage`.
`scheduleCount` uses `enabledSchedules` (enabled-only count), not total.

