## Workflow panel (`AgentAutomationPanels.tsx`)

### Step chain component
`<StepChain steps={wf.steps} />` renders steps connected with `<ChevronRight>` icons:

```tsx
<HStack gap={0} flexWrap="wrap">
  {steps.map((step, i) => (
    <>
      <Badge size="sm" variant="subtle" colorPalette="gray" borderRadius="full">{step}</Badge>
      {i < steps.length - 1 && <ChevronRight size={12} />}
    </>
  ))}
</HStack>
```

### Run result summary
After `runMutation.mutateAsync()`, call `parseResultSummary(result)` → `{ ok, summary }`.
Result displayed as a colored card (`green.subtle` / `red.subtle`) with a "Show raw output" toggle for the JSON dump.

### In-memory run history
`runHistory` state (max 10) shows recent runs in the left sidebar with `<CheckCircle>` / `<XCircle>` icons.

