## LiveStatsBar (`LiveStatsBar.tsx`)

6-cell grid: `engine slots | running batches | products | gateway LLM | CPU | uptime`

- `StatCell` accepts optional `href` → wraps the whole card in `<RouterLink>`
- LLM status uses `<StatusBadge>` instead of a text value — pull from `runtime?.ai?.llm_ready` and `runtime?.ai?.ai_enabled`
- Grid: `base: 1fr 1fr / sm: repeat(3) / md: repeat(6)`
- Skeleton count matches cell count: `<StatsGridSkeleton count={6} />`

---

## Project run execution

Server-side run flow: `POST /projects/{id}/run` → `ProjectRunnerService.start_run()` → background `_run_flow_task` → poll `GET /projects/{id}/runs/{run_id}` (800ms interval until terminal status).

Frontend hooks: `useProjectRunMutation`, `useProjectRunStopMutation`, `useProjectRunQuery` — in `hooks/queries/use-project-run-mutation.ts`.

Run store: `src/server/projects/run_store.py` — JSON files at `data/projects/_runs/{id}.json`.
